{"id":"wb-7-1271","name":"文光塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-09T06:20:01+00:00","status":"ready","title":"潮陽文光塔","text":"文光塔位于中国广东省汕头市潮阳区文光街道，为一座古塔，2013年被列入第七批全国重点文物保护单位。文光塔创建于于宋绍兴元年（1131年），是潮阳的旅游景点与名胜古迹之一。塔门石匾写有“文光塔”三字，左下刻“嘉庆乙亥孟冬”，右下刻“豫章唐文藻立”。塔门两边有一副对联:“千秋文笔振金石，百丈光芒贯斗牛”，是清朝潮阳知县唐文藻所撰。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%BD%AE%E9%99%BD%E6%96%87%E5%85%89%E5%A1%94","revisionId":89671157,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89671157","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/f0a62a9fd51a5dee98ff09ee.jpg","title":"Chaoyang wenguangta 2009.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Chaoyang_wenguangta_2009.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0e/Chaoyang_wenguangta_2009.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Polar1","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​潮阳文光塔","width":320,"height":427,"matchEvidence":"名称及地点核对一致"}}